WEBVTT

00:00:00.181 --> 00:00:04.214
To add <b>several products in a row</b>, when you restock

00:00:04.358 --> 00:00:06.731
Tick <b>Agregar otro al guardar</b> (Add another after saving)

00:00:06.794 --> 00:00:19.003
Enter the first one as usual

00:00:19.126 --> 00:00:24.198
When you save, the form <b>stays open</b> for the next one

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:28.946
The category stays; the prices <b>don't</b>, you enter them for each one

00:00:29.022 --> 00:00:40.999
Scan the next one and keep going

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:48.561
When you're done, <b>Terminar</b> (Done), and there are both
